{
  "slug": "claude-channel-whatsapp",
  "name": "Claude Channel Whatsapp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "WhatsApp messaging bridge via WhatsApp Web with built-in access control",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `access` (Manage WhatsApp channel access — approve pairings, edit allowlists, set DM policy), `configure` (Set up the WhatsApp channel — check connection status, manage auth)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `whatsapp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-channel-whatsapp@claude-community` from `PenguinMiaou/claude-channel-whatsapp`.",
